    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d19">

                <pb facs="0128" n="8" sameAs="frus:frus1905/pg8"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The President of Brazil to
                        President Roosevelt.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Translation.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Rio Janeiro</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1905-07-03"><hi rendition="#italic">July 3,
                        1905</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Please accept the assurance of my most profound regret at the death of the Hon.
                    John Hay, who was so intelligent and devoted an exponent of your international
                    policy.</p>
                <p>Your good friend,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Rodrigues Alves.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
